WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.636
A reshape round trip is not automatically reversible
If the pivot

00:00:05.663 --> 00:00:13.087
aggregated transaction rows to monthly totals
unpivoting can only recover those monthly totals It

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:19.123
cannot recreate the original transaction IDs or
individual amounts The

00:00:19.137 --> 00:00:21.637
grain that survives is the aggregated grain
